# PaperGraph Skill

> 命名说明（2026-08-17）：本设计原名 paper-knowledge-graph，与
> agent-canvas-demo/skills/paper-knowledge-graph（已实现、sidecar 驱动、
> 只产出 MENTIONS 边）重名。为避免接入时互相覆盖，本设计稿更名为
> paper-kg-llm-rag；它是完整 LLM+RAG 管线的目标形态，尚未实现。

## Input
Scientific PDF papers.

## Pipeline

1. Parse PDF with Docling/GROBID.
2. Extract metadata.
3. Use LLM structured output.
4. Build entity relationship graph.
5. Validate relations.
6. Export graph.
7. Visualize.

## Required Nodes

- Paper
- Author
- Institution
- Keyword
- KeywordCluster
- Experiment
- ExperimentalMethod
- Material
- TestMethod
- ExperimentalData
- Conclusion

## Required Relations

Paper - HAS_AUTHOR -> Author

Author - AFFILIATED_WITH -> Institution

Paper - HAS_KEYWORD -> Keyword

Keyword - BELONGS_TO -> KeywordCluster

Paper - HAS_EXPERIMENT -> Experiment

Experiment - USES_METHOD -> ExperimentalMethod

ExperimentalMethod - USES_MATERIAL -> Material

ExperimentalMethod - VERIFIED_BY -> TestMethod

Experiment - PRODUCES -> ExperimentalData

ExperimentalData - SUPPORTS -> Conclusion

## Evidence

Every node and relation should keep:
- paper_id
- page
- section
- evidence_text
- confidence
